+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+This project's cache eviction strategy is LRU (Least Recently Used) with a 300-second time-to-live (TTL) applied to cache entries: entries expire automatically after 300 seconds, and among unexpired entries capacity pressure is resolved by evicting the least recently used one first.
